(4551249, 654120, 53316, '<td valign="top">Your title sounds contrived to me, and I wish the creases in the fabric weren''t as evident. But aside from that, I really think this image is perfect. It definitely meets the challenge, and it is so sexy while being really tasteful and *pretty*. The pose is great and I like the lighting.  And the eye makeup gives it an extra "wow".  Great job and I hope you do well!</td>', 'Your title sounds contrived to me, and I wish the creases in the fabric weren''t as evident. But aside from that, I really think this image is perfect. It definitely meets the challenge, and it is so sexy while being really tasteful and *pretty*. The pose is great and I like the lighting.  And the eye makeup gives it an extra "wow".  Great job and I hope you do well!', '2008-03-10 00:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
