(4551462, 654100, 68035, '<td valign="top">very nice composition that meets the challenge well.  I am not sure whether it was just the weather conditions but there almost seems to be a little haze over parts of the shots which are nuting the colours slightly. 6</td>', 'very nice composition that meets the challenge well.  I am not sure whether it was just the weather conditions but there almost seems to be a little haze over parts of the shots which are nuting the colours slightly. 6', '2008-03-10 06:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
