(4551467, 656039, 68035, '<td valign="top">Cute image, which meets the challenge well, feels like the focus may be just a tad off and that the sharpness of the bunny has been lost to that of the box.  Strong colours especially in the foreground</td>', 'Cute image, which meets the challenge well, feels like the focus may be just a tad off and that the sharpness of the bunny has been lost to that of the box.  Strong colours especially in the foreground', '2008-03-10 06:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551470, 656292, 68035, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea and I like the sharpness of the claws and the eyes of the hermit crab.  From a personal perspective I do find the reflection to be a little distracting.  Nice colours</td>', 'Really nice idea and I like the sharpness of the claws and the eyes of the hermit crab.  From a personal perspective I do find the reflection to be a little distracting.  Nice colours', '2008-03-10 06:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551473, 656241, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love this birds eye view type of image and I think you have pulled it off well.  I am not too sure how well it will do with some DPC literalists in terms of scores but from a personal perpspectibe I totally get the idea that you are ''peeking'' over a railing or bannister at someone.  Nice complementary colours and I like the stones on the other side of the window</td>', 'I love this birds eye view type of image and I think you have pulled it off well.  I am not too sure how well it will do with some DPC literalists in terms of scores but from a personal perpspectibe I totally get the idea that you are ''peeking'' over a railing or bannister at someone.  Nice complementary colours and I like the stones on the other side of the window', '2008-03-10 06:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551477, 655561, 68035, '<td valign="top">A bizarre pun which for some reason makes me giggle<br/> <br/>Nice sharpness and colours although (from a personal perspective)there are a couple of places on the cut out keyhole which are quite distracting (right at the very top the hole line is a little jagged and it looks like there is a little fold in the card on the right innermost point near the cows food)<br/> <br/>Just read that comment back and it sounds very pedantic, but it is very small things like that that can on occasion stop a good picture from being a great one.<br/> <br/>Emphasis should still be that this is a good picture!!</td>', 'A bizarre pun which for some reason makes me giggle Nice sharpness and colours although (from a personal perspective)there are a couple of places on the cut out keyhole which are quite distracting (right at the very top the hole line is a little jagged and it looks like there is a little fold in the card on the right innermost point near the cows food) Just read that comment back and it sounds very pedantic, but it is very small things like that that can on occasion stop a good picture from being a great one. Emphasis should still be that this is a good picture!!', '2008-03-10 06:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551480, 656327, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot with a slightly olden day feeling about it (for some reason the wmoan in the window makes me think of a 1920''s debutante!!??)<br/> <br/>Love the spots colour on the white canvas (they are vivid without being overpowering)<br/> <br/>Possibly could have done with a touch of straightening so that the boards lay parallel, but that is just a minor issue</td>', 'Very nice shot with a slightly olden day feeling about it (for some reason the wmoan in the window makes me think of a 1920''s debutante!!??) Love the spots colour on the white canvas (they are vivid without being overpowering) Possibly could have done with a touch of straightening so that the boards lay parallel, but that is just a minor issue', '2008-03-10 06:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551485, 653912, 68035, '<td valign="top">I actually came back to this one as the first time I looked at it I thought ''hmmm nice animal shot but not sure it really hits the challenge''.  Then looking at it further I realised that whilst for a human this would be a profile looking straight ahead with the reptile''s pivot eyes it is actually ''peeking'' at the camera.<br/> <br/>Very clever idea and nicely delivered</td>', 'I actually came back to this one as the first time I looked at it I thought ''hmmm nice animal shot but not sure it really hits the challenge''.  Then looking at it further I realised that whilst for a human this would be a profile looking straight ahead with the reptile''s pivot eyes it is actually ''peeking'' at the camera. Very clever idea and nicely delivered', '2008-03-10 06:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4551489, 654206, 68035, '<td valign="top">really nice shot that meets the challenge well.  Absolutely sublime sharpness on the fence and the goats face and great colours that are set off even more by the bokeh sky.  9 from me</td>', 'really nice shot that meets the challenge well.  Absolutely sublime sharpness on the fence and the goats face and great colours that are set off even more by the bokeh sky.  9 from me', '2008-03-10 06:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
