(4553973, 656271, 89723, '<td valign="top">I really like your interpretation of the challenge and its obvious your model was having a blast. My only critique is I wish I could see her eyes a little more. Maybe a light from a different angle but other than that I think this is a nice shot. Rated well above my average.</td>', 'I really like your interpretation of the challenge and its obvious your model was having a blast. My only critique is I wish I could see her eyes a little more. Maybe a light from a different angle but other than that I think this is a nice shot. Rated well above my average.', '2008-03-11 00:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
