(4553975, 655582, 89723, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Thanks for your interpretation. I''m sure when the dust settles you will be near the top.</td>', 'Great shot. Thanks for your interpretation. I''m sure when the dust settles you will be near the top.', '2008-03-11 00:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553976, 655437, 89723, '<td valign="top">Capturing anticipation without using a facial expression is very difficult, but I think you pulled it off very nicely. Great shot.</td>', 'Capturing anticipation without using a facial expression is very difficult, but I think you pulled it off very nicely. Great shot.', '2008-03-11 00:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553977, 655787, 89723, '<td valign="top">I know it''s difficult working with animals, but I would have loved to see a little more peek and less boo in this shot. With that being said I did vote for it well above my average because I think the other elements in the shot are excellent. I like the colors and the cat certainly begs for my eye. Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I know it''s difficult working with animals, but I would have loved to see a little more peek and less boo in this shot. With that being said I did vote for it well above my average because I think the other elements in the shot are excellent. I like the colors and the cat certainly begs for my eye. Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2008-03-11 00:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553978, 656273, 89723, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. If I was being picky I would just say maybe it needs a tighter crop. I don''t think the trees add any value to your photo. They seem to be more distracting than anything else.</td>', 'Nice shot. If I was being picky I would just say maybe it needs a tighter crop. I don''t think the trees add any value to your photo. They seem to be more distracting than anything else.', '2008-03-11 00:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553979, 655301, 89723, '<td valign="top">Love the creativity. This may sound picky, but I would have liked to see the window blacked out to give the feeling like you were peering into a dark sky full of stars. The dilemma with that approach of course is how do you solve your lighting issue. I think you still could have done it with a light low on the ground in front of you pointing towards the ceiling. I do hope your picture does well in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the creativity. This may sound picky, but I would have liked to see the window blacked out to give the feeling like you were peering into a dark sky full of stars. The dilemma with that approach of course is how do you solve your lighting issue. I think you still could have done it with a light low on the ground in front of you pointing towards the ceiling. I do hope your picture does well in the challenge.', '2008-03-11 00:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553980, 656131, 89723, '<td valign="top">Great shot. One minor issue is the shiny eye. A little to much light, but other than that I think you have yourself a great picture.</td>', 'Great shot. One minor issue is the shiny eye. A little to much light, but other than that I think you have yourself a great picture.', '2008-03-11 00:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553981, 656206, 89723, '<td valign="top">Enjoyed your photo. I know you can''t pick the color of leaf this little bugger is crawling on, but maybe you could of darkened the background to make him a bit more prominent. Good Job.</td>', 'Enjoyed your photo. I know you can''t pick the color of leaf this little bugger is crawling on, but maybe you could of darkened the background to make him a bit more prominent. Good Job.', '2008-03-11 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553982, 656240, 89723, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. My only suggestion might be to remove the dog''s collar. What appears to be a license is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot. My only suggestion might be to remove the dog''s collar. What appears to be a license is a bit distracting.', '2008-03-11 00:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553983, 656246, 89723, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of the challenge and commend you on your originality. I think I would have preferred your hand not being seen. I also may have used a black background vice on with so much going on. Good job and good luck.</td>', 'I like your interpretation of the challenge and commend you on your originality. I think I would have preferred your hand not being seen. I also may have used a black background vice on with so much going on. Good job and good luck.', '2008-03-11 00:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553984, 656325, 89723, '<td valign="top">Okay! you scared me! :) Nice shot.</td>', 'Okay! you scared me! :) Nice shot.', '2008-03-11 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553985, 656268, 89723, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the picture appears to be a little out of focus to me. I would have loved this picture if the eyes were a little sharper. Still voted above my average.</td>', 'Nice concept, but the picture appears to be a little out of focus to me. I would have loved this picture if the eyes were a little sharper. Still voted above my average.', '2008-03-11 00:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553986, 655774, 89723, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Great color</td>', 'Nice photo. Great color', '2008-03-11 00:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553987, 656126, 89723, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that I can''t really figure out what kind of animal is in the log, but I probably wouldn''t mess with it. (I think it''s a fox) I hope no one was injured. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the fact that I can''t really figure out what kind of animal is in the log, but I probably wouldn''t mess with it. (I think it''s a fox) I hope no one was injured. Nice shot.', '2008-03-11 00:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553988, 656241, 89723, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and great perspective. I find taking these types of shots difficult for me. I haven''t quite mastered taking advantage of natural light. I''m really in no position to critique this shot beyond what I''ve said. Thanks for your interpretation.</td>', 'Good clarity and great perspective. I find taking these types of shots difficult for me. I haven''t quite mastered taking advantage of natural light. I''m really in no position to critique this shot beyond what I''ve said. Thanks for your interpretation.', '2008-03-11 00:30:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4553989, 656232, 89723, '<td valign="top">Though some might ding you on your interpretation of peek a boo, I love it.</td>', 'Though some might ding you on your interpretation of peek a boo, I love it.', '2008-03-11 00:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553990, 655595, 89723, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this fits into the challenges criteria, but based on the technical aspects of the photo I think you did a great job.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this fits into the challenges criteria, but based on the technical aspects of the photo I think you did a great job.', '2008-03-11 00:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553991, 654053, 89723, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation, but I wish the crop wasn''t so close to the eyes or at least they were equal on each side. On a positive side the eye color is amazing.</td>', 'I like your interpretation, but I wish the crop wasn''t so close to the eyes or at least they were equal on each side. On a positive side the eye color is amazing.', '2008-03-11 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553992, 654926, 89723, '<td valign="top">Cute picture.</td>', 'Cute picture.', '2008-03-11 00:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553993, 656233, 89723, '<td valign="top">Not one of my favorites, but I do appreciate your interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Not one of my favorites, but I do appreciate your interpretation of the challenge.', '2008-03-11 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553994, 653912, 89723, '<td valign="top">My only critique is that there appears to be some type of hair in the bottom left hand corner that is distracting me. Good job.</td>', 'My only critique is that there appears to be some type of hair in the bottom left hand corner that is distracting me. Good job.', '2008-03-11 00:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553995, 656238, 89723, '<td valign="top">This shot certainly meets the criteria of the challenge. I might have tried to crop it a bit tighter. I know it''s important to get the boat, but even in this shot you can''t see the whole thing. I think with a tighter crop more focus from the viewer would fall on the subject. As I look at the photo I can''t help but look to the left because of the letter on the boat.</td>', 'This shot certainly meets the criteria of the challenge. I might have tried to crop it a bit tighter. I know it''s important to get the boat, but even in this shot you can''t see the whole thing. I think with a tighter crop more focus from the viewer would fall on the subject. As I look at the photo I can''t help but look to the left because of the letter on the boat.', '2008-03-11 00:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4553996, 656012, 89723, '<td valign="top">Enjoyed your humorous interpretation of the challenge. In the future I would move the lighting around eliminate some of the harsh shadowing and washout. (particularly on the arm)</td>', 'Enjoyed your humorous interpretation of the challenge. In the future I would move the lighting around eliminate some of the harsh shadowing and washout. (particularly on the arm)', '2008-03-11 00:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
