(4555409, 656112, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the closeness of this shot.  You can see the texture of the cards and it looks like the cards are separated slightly, not all stacked up in a pile...that adds nice dimension.</td>', 'I like the closeness of this shot.  You can see the texture of the cards and it looks like the cards are separated slightly, not all stacked up in a pile...that adds nice dimension.', '2008-03-11 16:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4555412, 656188, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is just too funny.  As an aside, do people know that sculpture is there?  The angle is quite nice and the reflections in the window actually contribute to the scene.</td>', 'This is just too funny.  As an aside, do people know that sculpture is there?  The angle is quite nice and the reflections in the window actually contribute to the scene.', '2008-03-11 16:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4555415, 656250, 88718, '<td valign="top">Good action shot with nice expression and movement.</td>', 'Good action shot with nice expression and movement.', '2008-03-11 16:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4555432, 655595, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful photograph, but I''m not sure it works for this challenge. Would have been perfect for wabi-sabi, though :-)</td>', 'This is a very beautiful photograph, but I''m not sure it works for this challenge. Would have been perfect for wabi-sabi, though :-)', '2008-03-11 16:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4555434, 655375, 70299, '<td valign="top">I don''t know...it''s hard for me to vote on something like this because it lacks a real subject...which I realize one could argue with me on that.  Maybe it just likes real interest that would normally draw me into a picture.</td>', 'I don''t know...it''s hard for me to vote on something like this because it lacks a real subject...which I realize one could argue with me on that.  Maybe it just likes real interest that would normally draw me into a picture.', '2008-03-11 16:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4555446, 655269, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  The angles of the bricks behind the design in the window makes for a pleasing effect.  The colors work to keep things from being too busy.  You did a nice job finding clothing and make up to enhance the environment.  Well designed.</td>', 'Very creative.  The angles of the bricks behind the design in the window makes for a pleasing effect.  The colors work to keep things from being too busy.  You did a nice job finding clothing and make up to enhance the environment.  Well designed.', '2008-03-11 16:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
