(4555754, 656085, 55892, '<td valign="top">Eww, this gives me the creepy crawlies!! It really fits the theme.    I think the contrast   between the l. side of the face &amp; the dark background on the rt could be more pronounced.  Or, take out the neck &amp; shoulder;leave it all black except for the eye, &amp; have it more centered in the hole in the fabric.  Very creative.</td>', 'Eww, this gives me the creepy crawlies!! It really fits the theme.    I think the contrast   between the l. side of the face & the dark background on the rt could be more pronounced.  Or, take out the neck & shoulder;leave it all black except for the eye, & have it more centered in the hole in the fabric.  Very creative.', '2008-03-11 18:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
