(4555815, 656229, 55892, '<td valign="top">I love the composition here!  The complementary colors of her face &amp; the brick work nicely.  That little chunk of mortar hanging just in the corner of her eye emphasing only one eye visible, but it gives me a feeling of impending doom. ("be careful, don''t poke your eye out").  But maybe that''s just my dark side influencing me.</td>', 'I love the composition here!  The complementary colors of her face & the brick work nicely.  That little chunk of mortar hanging just in the corner of her eye emphasing only one eye visible, but it gives me a feeling of impending doom. ("be careful, don''t poke your eye out").  But maybe that''s just my dark side influencing me.', '2008-03-11 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4555816, 656327, 83416, '<td valign="top">I like the mystery and the retro look. In my opinion this image definitely deserves to be among the winners!</td>', 'I like the mystery and the retro look. In my opinion this image definitely deserves to be among the winners!', '2008-03-11 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
