(4556322, 656204, 12661, '<td valign="top">While nice in and of itself, the photo could really have been nicer if you shot at a shallower angle allowing more of the fence to show to the right. Then, with a shallow depth of field, the right sight of the fence could be forced out of focus. (Of course, this is assuming that they is actually enough fence to do this)</td>', 'While nice in and of itself, the photo could really have been nicer if you shot at a shallower angle allowing more of the fence to show to the right. Then, with a shallow depth of field, the right sight of the fence could be forced out of focus. (Of course, this is assuming that they is actually enough fence to do this)', '2008-03-11 22:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556330, 656112, 12661, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of DOF. Personally, I would have changed two things; only have the one card face up, and cover more of the queen, leaving just the eyes. Those recommendations are just for the sake of the theme, not on the photo itself.</td>', 'Interesting use of DOF. Personally, I would have changed two things; only have the one card face up, and cover more of the queen, leaving just the eyes. Those recommendations are just for the sake of the theme, not on the photo itself.', '2008-03-11 22:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556331, 655926, 18367, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this image I immediately thought of the movie "Cranky Old Men" I believe it was.  Very well done... one of the best "Peeks" in the challenge.</td>', 'When I first saw this image I immediately thought of the movie "Cranky Old Men" I believe it was.  Very well done... one of the best "Peeks" in the challenge.', '2008-03-11 22:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556336, 655839, 12661, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the subject is a bit dark, perhaps as a result of trying to black out the interior. Perhaps using depth of field to blur the interior background could have worked nicer.</td>', 'The lighting on the subject is a bit dark, perhaps as a result of trying to black out the interior. Perhaps using depth of field to blur the interior background could have worked nicer.', '2008-03-11 22:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556343, 656039, 12661, '<td valign="top">The box is extremely bright (almost blinding) making it difficult to place my attention on the bunny. However, if I cover the bottom, the top part is very nicely done. The softness of the blues plays very nicely with the plush look of the bunny.</td>', 'The box is extremely bright (almost blinding) making it difficult to place my attention on the bunny. However, if I cover the bottom, the top part is very nicely done. The softness of the blues plays very nicely with the plush look of the bunny.', '2008-03-11 22:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556351, 656228, 70299, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting shot!  I love the smile on the squirrel''s face!  Lucky.  I bet you had to sneak up really slow.</td>', 'That''s an interesting shot!  I love the smile on the squirrel''s face!  Lucky.  I bet you had to sneak up really slow.', '2008-03-11 22:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556353, 656287, 12661, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of Grand Central. I like the contrast between the color tone and the people standing which portrays calmness vs the blurred walkers and the location which hints towards urgency.</td>', 'Lovely shot of Grand Central. I like the contrast between the color tone and the people standing which portrays calmness vs the blurred walkers and the location which hints towards urgency.', '2008-03-11 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556355, 656066, 12661, '<td valign="top">I find that the high level of contrast gives at an unnatural feel. I like the technique in a man-made situation, but don''t personally enjoy it in a otherwise natural setting.</td>', 'I find that the high level of contrast gives at an unnatural feel. I like the technique in a man-made situation, but don''t personally enjoy it in a otherwise natural setting.', '2008-03-11 22:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
