(4556363, 654529, 70299, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  I really like the colors...and this is interesting and intriguing.  I see a lot of entries that don''t seem to get the nature of this challenge.  This say''s Peek-A-Boo to me!  And I know for a fact, that cats LOVE to play peek-a-boo!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  I really like the colors...and this is interesting and intriguing.  I see a lot of entries that don''t seem to get the nature of this challenge.  This say''s Peek-A-Boo to me!  And I know for a fact, that cats LOVE to play peek-a-boo!', '2008-03-11 22:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556366, 656318, 70299, '<td valign="top">This seems like it''s in the wrong challenge...maybe a blurry mess?  Probably a good high score in the Blurry Mess challenge.  Just because there are eyes (and a lot of them) doesn''t make it fit the peek-a-boo challenge.  Creative and interesting...I''ll give you that!</td>', 'This seems like it''s in the wrong challenge...maybe a blurry mess?  Probably a good high score in the Blurry Mess challenge.  Just because there are eyes (and a lot of them) doesn''t make it fit the peek-a-boo challenge.  Creative and interesting...I''ll give you that!', '2008-03-11 22:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4556367, 656234, 12661, '<td valign="top">This photo is proof of the difficulties of taking outdoor photographs in the mid-day sun. The bright section of the trunk overpowers the softness of the child (beautiful capture of the soft skin tone, btw) and also contrasts with the sudden jump to shade on the right side.</td>', 'This photo is proof of the difficulties of taking outdoor photographs in the mid-day sun. The bright section of the trunk overpowers the softness of the child (beautiful capture of the soft skin tone, btw) and also contrasts with the sudden jump to shade on the right side.', '2008-03-11 22:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
