(4559509, 656229, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Could''ve done without the hair holders around the wrist.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Could''ve done without the hair holders around the wrist.', '2008-03-12 20:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559512, 656029, 90658, '<td valign="top">To my eye, the focal point seems to be the paw.  You''ve captured a beautiful creature in a stunning environment.  That eye is captivating.  Image how much better it would be if the focus was on the eye.</td>', 'To my eye, the focal point seems to be the paw.  You''ve captured a beautiful creature in a stunning environment.  That eye is captivating.  Image how much better it would be if the focus was on the eye.', '2008-03-12 20:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559514, 656012, 90658, '<td valign="top">Who ever this is, I''m sure they hear all the time that they look like Will Farrell.  I found this humerous and well done.  I would have liked to see more eye.  The sweater is cutting in right at the corner and you are losing the line and expression.</td>', 'Who ever this is, I''m sure they hear all the time that they look like Will Farrell.  I found this humerous and well done.  I would have liked to see more eye.  The sweater is cutting in right at the corner and you are losing the line and expression.', '2008-03-12 20:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559517, 654691, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is just a wonderful shot of Granny.  It almost seems as if you caught her too soon in the smile.  The expression hasn''t reached her eyes yet, plus the squint.</td>', 'This is just a wonderful shot of Granny.  It almost seems as if you caught her too soon in the smile.  The expression hasn''t reached her eyes yet, plus the squint.', '2008-03-12 21:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559519, 656326, 90658, '<td valign="top">I actually like the fact that you went with the scared idea of peek-a-boo.  It is just a weensy bit too dark for my tastes.</td>', 'I actually like the fact that you went with the scared idea of peek-a-boo.  It is just a weensy bit too dark for my tastes.', '2008-03-12 21:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559522, 656136, 90658, '<td valign="top">Way to capture the expression of sheer frustration in poochy.  You can tell that he is done playing now, and wants some love.</td>', 'Way to capture the expression of sheer frustration in poochy.  You can tell that he is done playing now, and wants some love.', '2008-03-12 21:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559530, 656246, 90658, '<td valign="top">I stared and stared and thought and thought about this shot.  The coloring is so unique, and the lighting is perfect to convey the mysticism.  My only issue is that while I like the blueish tinge on your subject''s face, it seems to have gone too far.  He looks almost dead.  The only thing keeping it from being totally deadish is the eyes.  Of course, that is probably what you were going for so...</td>', 'I stared and stared and thought and thought about this shot.  The coloring is so unique, and the lighting is perfect to convey the mysticism.  My only issue is that while I like the blueish tinge on your subject''s face, it seems to have gone too far.  He looks almost dead.  The only thing keeping it from being totally deadish is the eyes.  Of course, that is probably what you were going for so...', '2008-03-12 21:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559532, 656056, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well captured.  The squirrel must have been resting.</td>', 'Well captured.  The squirrel must have been resting.', '2008-03-12 21:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559533, 656270, 90658, '<td valign="top">So much enjoyment in the face of the little one!</td>', 'So much enjoyment in the face of the little one!', '2008-03-12 21:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559546, 656085, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be more pleasing to me, if the eye were lower in the tube.  Not centered, but lower.  At it''s current placement, the corners of the eye are cut off and you lose the line of the eye.  The green would really stand out more, if we had the entire area to look at.</td>', 'I think this shot would be more pleasing to me, if the eye were lower in the tube.  Not centered, but lower.  At it''s current placement, the corners of the eye are cut off and you lose the line of the eye.  The green would really stand out more, if we had the entire area to look at.', '2008-03-12 21:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559547, 656209, 90658, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a different colored background to really set off his eyes...the intensity and the color.</td>', 'Perhaps a different colored background to really set off his eyes...the intensity and the color.', '2008-03-12 21:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559558, 656231, 90658, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t tell if this was a real chimp or a sculpture.  I''m guessing real as there seem to be tufts of hair around the knee that would be really hard to carve.  The fact that I couldn''t tell, was my discomfort.  The editing might have gone too far to bring me to this point.</td>', 'I couldn''t tell if this was a real chimp or a sculpture.  I''m guessing real as there seem to be tufts of hair around the knee that would be really hard to carve.  The fact that I couldn''t tell, was my discomfort.  The editing might have gone too far to bring me to this point.', '2008-03-12 21:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559574, 656123, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very cute picture.  I think that there is just too much pink.  Or perhaps the lighting is wrong.  Whatever it is, the skin looks orange to me.  I''ve looked at this on several computers, with several different monitors and at different resolutions and I still see orange in the skin.</td>', 'Very cute picture.  I think that there is just too much pink.  Or perhaps the lighting is wrong.  Whatever it is, the skin looks orange to me.  I''ve looked at this on several computers, with several different monitors and at different resolutions and I still see orange in the skin.', '2008-03-12 21:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559575, 656126, 90658, '<td valign="top">Was this a real animal?  Freaky!</td>', 'Was this a real animal?  Freaky!', '2008-03-12 21:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559580, 656222, 90658, '<td valign="top">I just love the contrast between the pinks and the black.  I think it could''ve been sharper, then the "pop" would really be "POP."</td>', 'I just love the contrast between the pinks and the black.  I think it could''ve been sharper, then the "pop" would really be "POP."', '2008-03-12 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559581, 655167, 90658, '<td valign="top">Love the blue of the eyes against the gray &amp; white of the box.  Watch the reflections in the eyes.</td>', 'Love the blue of the eyes against the gray & white of the box.  Watch the reflections in the eyes.', '2008-03-12 21:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559582, 655899, 90658, '<td valign="top">The expression on your subject''s face is incredible.  I like the overall shot, my only complaint would be the red fingernail polish.  Either go without it, or make sure the nails are long enough to handle a color like red.  This is extremely nit-picky, as there is nothing wrong with using the red to tie in with everything else, it''s just that the small stuff can have a HUGE impact for the positive or negative.</td>', 'The expression on your subject''s face is incredible.  I like the overall shot, my only complaint would be the red fingernail polish.  Either go without it, or make sure the nails are long enough to handle a color like red.  This is extremely nit-picky, as there is nothing wrong with using the red to tie in with everything else, it''s just that the small stuff can have a HUGE impact for the positive or negative.', '2008-03-12 21:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559584, 656051, 90658, '<td valign="top">Hilarious.  I think since everything is so exagerated here, that the background color should be brighter, keep it a neutral, but not gray.  Or have the subject wear a different sleeve color...again something bright.  (I wouldn''t do both, though).</td>', 'Hilarious.  I think since everything is so exagerated here, that the background color should be brighter, keep it a neutral, but not gray.  Or have the subject wear a different sleeve color...again something bright.  (I wouldn''t do both, though).', '2008-03-12 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559585, 656131, 90658, '<td valign="top">Lots of personality here.  I''m thinking that the doggy door is communicated pretty well and you might be able to crop out more of the cream door.</td>', 'Lots of personality here.  I''m thinking that the doggy door is communicated pretty well and you might be able to crop out more of the cream door.', '2008-03-12 21:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559594, 655839, 90658, '<td valign="top">The editing was not your friend here.  The face of the subject doesn''t seem natural.</td>', 'The editing was not your friend here.  The face of the subject doesn''t seem natural.', '2008-03-12 21:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559598, 655975, 90658, '<td valign="top">I liked the juxtaposition of the reading eyes with the eyes on the book.  Just wondering if you tried sepia or leaving it in color?</td>', 'I liked the juxtaposition of the reading eyes with the eyes on the book.  Just wondering if you tried sepia or leaving it in color?', '2008-03-12 21:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559599, 656241, 90658, '<td valign="top">The colors work well together.</td>', 'The colors work well together.', '2008-03-12 21:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559607, 654926, 90658, '<td valign="top">Cute, cute smile.  Well captured.  To me it seems very snap-shotty.  Albeit, a GOOD snap-shot.</td>', 'Cute, cute smile.  Well captured.  To me it seems very snap-shotty.  Albeit, a GOOD snap-shot.', '2008-03-12 21:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559610, 656240, 90658, '<td valign="top">I feel as if the natural colors of the leaves and bark were over-editted.  There is a lack of textural difference between the trees and the forest floor.</td>', 'I feel as if the natural colors of the leaves and bark were over-editted.  There is a lack of textural difference between the trees and the forest floor.', '2008-03-12 21:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559614, 653912, 90658, '<td valign="top">I little more cropping to get rid of the grass or hair or whatever is in the lower left corner.</td>', 'I little more cropping to get rid of the grass or hair or whatever is in the lower left corner.', '2008-03-12 21:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559615, 655595, 90658, '<td valign="top">The detail from the b&amp;w is nice</td>', 'The detail from the b&w is nice', '2008-03-12 21:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559626, 656234, 83313, '<td valign="top">The traditional peek a boo shot that I expected to see, but the light and color came together quite well on this. The kids face being in shadows a bit is my only minor quibble.</td>', 'The traditional peek a boo shot that I expected to see, but the light and color came together quite well on this. The kids face being in shadows a bit is my only minor quibble.', '2008-03-12 21:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559630, 656249, 83313, '<td valign="top">The standard peekaboo shot, but how cute can ya'' get!?</td>', 'The standard peekaboo shot, but how cute can ya'' get!?', '2008-03-12 21:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559634, 655720, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well, this one stumped me.  I tried really hard to find the connection to the challenge...this is what I came up with.  The flower got scared and dropped it''s petals because of the BOO!  That being said.  Nicely done, simple, elegant, well designed.  I think a different color background.  However, since I had to work so hard finding the connection to the challenge, I dropped a few points on my vote.  In a free study or still life, I would have gone with 8-10 depending on the competition.</td>', 'Well, this one stumped me.  I tried really hard to find the connection to the challenge...this is what I came up with.  The flower got scared and dropped it''s petals because of the BOO!  That being said.  Nicely done, simple, elegant, well designed.  I think a different color background.  However, since I had to work so hard finding the connection to the challenge, I dropped a few points on my vote.  In a free study or still life, I would have gone with 8-10 depending on the competition.', '2008-03-12 21:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559635, 656211, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the stark contrast in colors.</td>', 'I like the stark contrast in colors.', '2008-03-12 21:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559639, 656328, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the theme. Very colorful and I love the reflection. Not the traditional peek a boo idea, but I''ll give you credit for a unique interpretation.</td>', 'Interesting take on the theme. Very colorful and I love the reflection. Not the traditional peek a boo idea, but I''ll give you credit for a unique interpretation.', '2008-03-12 21:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559640, 656320, 90658, '<td valign="top">This just freaked me out.</td>', 'This just freaked me out.', '2008-03-12 21:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559647, 656157, 90658, '<td valign="top">Fun-loving crowd.  There are some extras that could be removed...the chair being one.  A little more thought to the surroundings and this moves from GOOD snap-shot to the beginnings of art.</td>', 'Fun-loving crowd.  There are some extras that could be removed...the chair being one.  A little more thought to the surroundings and this moves from GOOD snap-shot to the beginnings of art.', '2008-03-12 21:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559653, 656291, 83313, '<td valign="top">So, you gonna put down the camera and follow her? Even big girls can play this game! <br/> <br/>Contrast and clarity is a little low, the picture is just ok, but I like the take on the theme.</td>', 'So, you gonna put down the camera and follow her? Even big girls can play this game!  Contrast and clarity is a little low, the picture is just ok, but I like the take on the theme.', '2008-03-12 21:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559655, 655835, 90658, '<td valign="top">Seems out of balance to me.  A little more cropping on the left, a little less on the right.  Not that centering is a good idea, because then you lose the angles, but things just feel wonky to me.</td>', 'Seems out of balance to me.  A little more cropping on the left, a little less on the right.  Not that centering is a good idea, because then you lose the angles, but things just feel wonky to me.', '2008-03-12 21:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559662, 656248, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking. I don''t get the title or how it relates to his scene. Hope there''s an explanation in your notes post-challenge.</td>', 'Very cool looking. I don''t get the title or how it relates to his scene. Hope there''s an explanation in your notes post-challenge.', '2008-03-12 21:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559666, 655884, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of neat looking, though my first reaction was that she is wrapped up in a tablecloth. I see now that it''s a curtain.</td>', 'Kind of neat looking, though my first reaction was that she is wrapped up in a tablecloth. I see now that it''s a curtain.', '2008-03-12 21:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559668, 656123, 83313, '<td valign="top">Somebody is a proud parent!</td>', 'Somebody is a proud parent!', '2008-03-12 21:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559671, 656272, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Was this staged, or just a shot of opportunity? Awful cute either way.</td>', 'Wonderful! Was this staged, or just a shot of opportunity? Awful cute either way.', '2008-03-12 21:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559676, 655437, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, and good use of b/w, however my first impression was that this kid was being punished instead of playing. Might be they way the arms are being held.</td>', 'Nice texture, and good use of b/w, however my first impression was that this kid was being punished instead of playing. Might be they way the arms are being held.', '2008-03-12 21:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559684, 655554, 83313, '<td valign="top">I want to call this a shoehorn, but I''m keeping on open mind on the interpretation of the theme. That middle leaf IS peeking out from between.</td>', 'I want to call this a shoehorn, but I''m keeping on open mind on the interpretation of the theme. That middle leaf IS peeking out from between.', '2008-03-12 21:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559685, 654120, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea with the crepey-silky cloth back-lit to show the body profile behind the drape.  Great color scheme, the red vs the ivory skin tone, against the neutral blue/gray.  What keeps this from being really elegant is the angle of the model''s head and the make-up and hair.  Sometimes design has to take you all the way into dictating what stands before you.  I like the "fly-away" strands, but the rest of the hair is pulled back too tightly.  A softer bun or free falling hair with a fan blowing it back would be better.  The make-up is too harsh for the softness of everything else.  Less mascara, no false eyelashes, lighter lip gloss.  The green shadow could work if everything else was toned down.  (Or go the complete opposite...make EVERYTHING above the neck angular, severe and over the top...slick the hair completely back, go even darker with the make-up etc.)  What you have here is the beginnings of a GREAT fashion photo, that is being held back by a portrait.  If that makes sense.</td>', 'Very nice idea with the crepey-silky cloth back-lit to show the body profile behind the drape.  Great color scheme, the red vs the ivory skin tone, against the neutral blue/gray.  What keeps this from being really elegant is the angle of the model''s head and the make-up and hair.  Sometimes design has to take you all the way into dictating what stands before you.  I like the "fly-away" strands, but the rest of the hair is pulled back too tightly.  A softer bun or free falling hair with a fan blowing it back would be better.  The make-up is too harsh for the softness of everything else.  Less mascara, no false eyelashes, lighter lip gloss.  The green shadow could work if everything else was toned down.  (Or go the complete opposite...make EVERYTHING above the neck angular, severe and over the top...slick the hair completely back, go even darker with the make-up etc.)  What you have here is the beginnings of a GREAT fashion photo, that is being held back by a portrait.  If that makes sense.', '2008-03-12 21:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559686, 656325, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ahhh! You found me!!!</td>', 'Ahhh! You found me!!!', '2008-03-12 21:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559689, 654206, 90658, '<td valign="top">This just makes me happy to be alive.  :)</td>', 'This just makes me happy to be alive.  :)', '2008-03-12 21:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559693, 656301, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure this is really peekaboo, but I just gave the benefit of the doubt to another flower shot, so...</td>', 'Not sure this is really peekaboo, but I just gave the benefit of the doubt to another flower shot, so...', '2008-03-12 21:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559696, 655770, 90658, '<td valign="top">Colors are great.  There''s nothing that is inherently wrong with this, imo.  I just don''t feel it.  Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'Colors are great.  There''s nothing that is inherently wrong with this, imo.  I just don''t feel it.  Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-12 21:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559697, 655429, 90658, '<td valign="top">Intersting editorial story in this.</td>', 'Intersting editorial story in this.', '2008-03-12 21:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559701, 656241, 70514, '<td valign="top">I find something so interesting about eavesdropping, and this seems to give off that vibe nicely.  Lovely composition and diagonals.</td>', 'I find something so interesting about eavesdropping, and this seems to give off that vibe nicely.  Lovely composition and diagonals.', '2008-03-12 21:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559704, 655847, 90658, '<td valign="top">Did you ecperiment with dof?  There does not seem to be much dimension here.</td>', 'Did you ecperiment with dof?  There does not seem to be much dimension here.', '2008-03-12 21:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559705, 654853, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  Seems a wee bit oof around the horns.  The atonality is great.  BTW, where did you find smurfs?  I haven''t seen them in years.</td>', 'Very creative!  Seems a wee bit oof around the horns.  The atonality is great.  BTW, where did you find smurfs?  I haven''t seen them in years.', '2008-03-12 21:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559706, 655848, 90658, '<td valign="top">Atonality works here.</td>', 'Atonality works here.', '2008-03-12 21:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559707, 656288, 90658, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Just not sure it fits in this challenge.  This would be a fantastic free study.</td>', 'Great shot!  Just not sure it fits in this challenge.  This would be a fantastic free study.', '2008-03-12 21:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559708, 655301, 90658, '<td valign="top">I really like that the telescope is the focus here.  It would have been easy to focus on the person.</td>', 'I really like that the telescope is the focus here.  It would have been easy to focus on the person.', '2008-03-12 21:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559709, 655595, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love how this was processed, really adds a punch of emotion.</td>', 'I love how this was processed, really adds a punch of emotion.', '2008-03-12 21:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559711, 655989, 83313, '<td valign="top">She looks more annoyed than surprised. Picture strikes me as just a snapshot, I''m afraid.</td>', 'She looks more annoyed than surprised. Picture strikes me as just a snapshot, I''m afraid.', '2008-03-12 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559718, 656325, 90658, '<td valign="top">I had a problem with the lighting.  Everything draws my eye to the nose, which is in focus, so I guess that''s ok.  But I would have liked to see more eyes.</td>', 'I had a problem with the lighting.  Everything draws my eye to the nose, which is in focus, so I guess that''s ok.  But I would have liked to see more eyes.', '2008-03-12 21:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559720, 656153, 90658, '<td valign="top">Patient kitty.  I just found this too dark.</td>', 'Patient kitty.  I just found this too dark.', '2008-03-12 21:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559730, 655167, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not really a sharp image here, but I really like how you saved it with the selective saturation.</td>', 'Not really a sharp image here, but I really like how you saved it with the selective saturation.', '2008-03-12 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559731, 656112, 70514, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus, nice attention grabber hear.</td>', 'Perfect focus, nice attention grabber hear.', '2008-03-12 21:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559735, 655926, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is fantastic.  It''s just that the greens and yellows of the hat overpower the eye, which I am assuming is the focus of the shot.  The facial expression is wonderful and the angle of shot adds drama.</td>', 'I think the idea is fantastic.  It''s just that the greens and yellows of the hat overpower the eye, which I am assuming is the focus of the shot.  The facial expression is wonderful and the angle of shot adds drama.', '2008-03-12 21:40:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4559738, 655167, 70514, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad the eyes aren''t in focus.  I''m distracted by the "Vizio" that is in focus.</td>', 'It''s too bad the eyes aren''t in focus.  I''m distracted by the "Vizio" that is in focus.', '2008-03-12 21:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559742, 656291, 90658, '<td valign="top">I felt that the colors were blown out.  It''s almost like you wanted the silhouette, then chickened out.</td>', 'I felt that the colors were blown out.  It''s almost like you wanted the silhouette, then chickened out.', '2008-03-12 21:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559743, 655988, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the art of this.  It is striking.</td>', 'I like the art of this.  It is striking.', '2008-03-12 21:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559746, 654120, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yes, please! <br/> <br/>Half naked women don''t improve a score, but a well done photo that fits the theme does. Not the usual interpretation, but it does fit and is well done.</td>', 'Yes, please!  Half naked women don''t improve a score, but a well done photo that fits the theme does. Not the usual interpretation, but it does fit and is well done.', '2008-03-12 21:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559753, 656308, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of angle of shot.  Not coming straight in adds a hint of mystery.  It''s just not a shot that grabs me.  Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'Interesting use of angle of shot.  Not coming straight in adds a hint of mystery.  It''s just not a shot that grabs me.  Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-03-12 21:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559755, 655884, 90658, '<td valign="top">I actually think the eye make-up is too harsh.  That is an awful lot of black right in the center of this shot, with the hair and the eyebrows and the mascara and the eyliner.  You''ve got a nice muted pink gloss on the lips and slight blush on the cheeks.  Perhaps a soft pink or pale blue, or even just a shimmer on the eyes, leaving off the eyeliner completely.</td>', 'I actually think the eye make-up is too harsh.  That is an awful lot of black right in the center of this shot, with the hair and the eyebrows and the mascara and the eyliner.  You''ve got a nice muted pink gloss on the lips and slight blush on the cheeks.  Perhaps a soft pink or pale blue, or even just a shimmer on the eyes, leaving off the eyeliner completely.', '2008-03-12 21:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559760, 654298, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ok, I see the face, but what exactly are those items in the snow that it is made of? Not a fantastic photo, but a great eye for spotting this in the landscape.</td>', 'Ok, I see the face, but what exactly are those items in the snow that it is made of? Not a fantastic photo, but a great eye for spotting this in the landscape.', '2008-03-12 21:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559768, 656272, 90658, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would look like with the rug partially unfolded.  Or a tighter shot towards the cat''s face.</td>', 'I wonder what this would look like with the rug partially unfolded.  Or a tighter shot towards the cat''s face.', '2008-03-12 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559770, 656128, 90658, '<td valign="top">It could just be me, but the black looks <i>slightly</i> off of horizontal.  I wuold also prefer to see more of the eyes.  The lower lid is cut off.</td>', 'It could just be me, but the black looks slightly off of horizontal.  I wuold also prefer to see more of the eyes.  The lower lid is cut off.', '2008-03-12 21:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
