(4559782, 656066, 90658, '<td valign="top">There''s alot going on here.  The elf doesn''t seem to be the focal point, imo.  Perhaps tighten the shot to the base of the tree or move the elf to the foreground (like just behind the log.)</td>', 'There''s alot going on here.  The elf doesn''t seem to be the focal point, imo.  Perhaps tighten the shot to the base of the tree or move the elf to the foreground (like just behind the log.)', '2008-03-12 21:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559787, 656292, 90658, '<td valign="top">The reflection is <u><i>almost</i></u> too much.  I feel a little confused about where the focal point is.</td>', 'The reflection is almost too much.  I feel a little confused about where the focal point is.', '2008-03-12 21:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559788, 656238, 90658, '<td valign="top">You almost don''t need the shoreline.  The bouys communicate that this is near land.</td>', 'You almost don''t need the shoreline.  The bouys communicate that this is near land.', '2008-03-12 21:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559789, 655885, 90658, '<td valign="top">To much shadow on the uncovered portion of the face, for my liking.  The white bacground adds emphasis to the raised arm, moving my focal point forward instead of back to the face.  On a personal note, I HATE it when girls wear their hair accessories on their wrists.  I am constantly telling my daughter to take them off or put them back in the hair...a pet peeve of mine that unfortunately, distracts from the rest of the shot.  Not, that they are an overall negative to this shot, in fact I would love to see someone make some sort of editorial comment on this fashion trend.</td>', 'To much shadow on the uncovered portion of the face, for my liking.  The white bacground adds emphasis to the raised arm, moving my focal point forward instead of back to the face.  On a personal note, I HATE it when girls wear their hair accessories on their wrists.  I am constantly telling my daughter to take them off or put them back in the hair...a pet peeve of mine that unfortunately, distracts from the rest of the shot.  Not, that they are an overall negative to this shot, in fact I would love to see someone make some sort of editorial comment on this fashion trend.', '2008-03-12 21:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559790, 656218, 90658, '<td valign="top">I would prefer a little sharper focus on the colt''s upper face.  I am visually drawn to the nose.</td>', 'I would prefer a little sharper focus on the colt''s upper face.  I am visually drawn to the nose.', '2008-03-12 21:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559791, 655259, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, this just doesn''t do much for me.  I have racked my brain to figure out why, so as to be constructive.  My biggest "issues" aren''t really your fault...taking a picture through glass into water.  You have no control over the cleanliness of the glass at an aquarium, so it''s not worth mentioning (or voting you down.)  I like the fact that there are actually two reflections of the girl.  Just overall, I am left feeling ho-hum with this.  Again, I don''t think you should take that as criticism, just as an example of how art "speaks" differently to different people.</td>', 'I''m sorry, this just doesn''t do much for me.  I have racked my brain to figure out why, so as to be constructive.  My biggest "issues" aren''t really your fault...taking a picture through glass into water.  You have no control over the cleanliness of the glass at an aquarium, so it''s not worth mentioning (or voting you down.)  I like the fact that there are actually two reflections of the girl.  Just overall, I am left feeling ho-hum with this.  Again, I don''t think you should take that as criticism, just as an example of how art "speaks" differently to different people.', '2008-03-12 21:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559792, 656271, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the "paleness" of this shot.  I would like to see more focus on the eyes behind the toys.</td>', 'I like the effect of the "paleness" of this shot.  I would like to see more focus on the eyes behind the toys.', '2008-03-12 21:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559793, 656114, 90658, '<td valign="top">Seems snap-shotish to me.  I''ve also never seen a yellow raccoon in the wild, not that there isn''t one, but the colors seem off to me.  Nice idea, though.</td>', 'Seems snap-shotish to me.  I''ve also never seen a yellow raccoon in the wild, not that there isn''t one, but the colors seem off to me.  Nice idea, though.', '2008-03-12 21:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559798, 655577, 83313, '<td valign="top">The details on the dog seem a bit over enhanced. the overall shot is ok, but not great. I can''t quite put my finger on a good suggestion though. Might be the lighting is just too plain, and a slight tilt to the pic.</td>', 'The details on the dog seem a bit over enhanced. the overall shot is ok, but not great. I can''t quite put my finger on a good suggestion though. Might be the lighting is just too plain, and a slight tilt to the pic.', '2008-03-12 21:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559806, 655986, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got wrong pepper.  A green or red would have added more depth to this shot, not to mention the hamster would be easier to see.  Also, the focal point seems to be in the upper left corner above the animal.  This, however, could be my eyes.</td>', 'I think you''ve got wrong pepper.  A green or red would have added more depth to this shot, not to mention the hamster would be easier to see.  Also, the focal point seems to be in the upper left corner above the animal.  This, however, could be my eyes.', '2008-03-12 21:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559808, 656175, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, this one just pops off the screen!</td>', 'Well, this one just pops off the screen!', '2008-03-12 21:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559811, 656179, 90658, '<td valign="top">I feel that the eye isn''t framed well.  The shadow from the thumb stops the line of the eye.  I would move the hand towards the ear.  Also, too much editing for my tastes.</td>', 'I feel that the eye isn''t framed well.  The shadow from the thumb stops the line of the eye.  I would move the hand towards the ear.  Also, too much editing for my tastes.', '2008-03-12 21:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559814, 656273, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very simple, yet effective.  Wish there was more greenery, though.</td>', 'Very simple, yet effective.  Wish there was more greenery, though.', '2008-03-12 21:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559815, 656062, 90658, '<td valign="top">Colors seem washed out.</td>', 'Colors seem washed out.', '2008-03-12 21:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559825, 656327, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really nice artistic treatment. I really like this one. I fact, I think I''ll fave it for future viewing.</td>', 'Really nice artistic treatment. I really like this one. I fact, I think I''ll fave it for future viewing.', '2008-03-12 21:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559832, 655698, 83313, '<td valign="top">Why bother with expensive pet toys when they love these things so much? Very cute.</td>', 'Why bother with expensive pet toys when they love these things so much? Very cute.', '2008-03-12 21:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559838, 656248, 90658, '<td valign="top">I feel that this was shoehorned into the challenge.  As a shot, by itself, very interesting and it could be fabulous in another setting.  So, if you removed the person, resaturated the colors of the hills and sky and put it into something that communicates vastness, you''ve have a knock-out.</td>', 'I feel that this was shoehorned into the challenge.  As a shot, by itself, very interesting and it could be fabulous in another setting.  So, if you removed the person, resaturated the colors of the hills and sky and put it into something that communicates vastness, you''ve have a knock-out.', '2008-03-12 21:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559839, 656039, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think the editing around the bunny went too far.  It seems surreal, not in a good way.</td>', 'I think the editing around the bunny went too far.  It seems surreal, not in a good way.', '2008-03-12 21:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559840, 655375, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking that this should have been either completely in soft focus or completely in sharp relief.  Right now, with the combo of the two, it seems unbalanced and oof.  i.e. my eyes go right to the eyebrows of the mask on the right, then I see the scarf of the woman.  The faces, as a whole, are the last thing I see.</td>', 'I''m thinking that this should have been either completely in soft focus or completely in sharp relief.  Right now, with the combo of the two, it seems unbalanced and oof.  i.e. my eyes go right to the eyebrows of the mask on the right, then I see the scarf of the woman.  The faces, as a whole, are the last thing I see.', '2008-03-12 21:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559848, 656022, 90658, '<td valign="top">The face of your subject communicates a ho-hum attitude and that''s what I get.  Perhaps cropping out all of the white on the right and elongating the top &amp; bottom to add more vertical interest...</td>', 'The face of your subject communicates a ho-hum attitude and that''s what I get.  Perhaps cropping out all of the white on the right and elongating the top & bottom to add more vertical interest...', '2008-03-12 21:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559851, 655835, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good animal shot, and it certainly meets the challenge, but I''m not personally finding it has much appeal to me.</td>', 'A good animal shot, and it certainly meets the challenge, but I''m not personally finding it has much appeal to me.', '2008-03-12 21:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559857, 656179, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and bold. I like the single pimped eye.</td>', 'Nice and bold. I like the single pimped eye.', '2008-03-12 21:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559860, 656328, 90658, '<td valign="top">The reflections of the colors on the glasses is a great idea.  But as art speaks differently to different people, I have to say, I just am not that excited when I see it.  There is no "wow, that''s phenominal."</td>', 'The reflections of the colors on the glasses is a great idea.  But as art speaks differently to different people, I have to say, I just am not that excited when I see it.  There is no "wow, that''s phenominal."', '2008-03-12 21:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559864, 655899, 83313, '<td valign="top">A basic interpretation of the theme, but extremely well done. Looks like some serious studio work on this. She''s got big, wide eyes. I''m a sucker for big eyes.</td>', 'A basic interpretation of the theme, but extremely well done. Looks like some serious studio work on this. She''s got big, wide eyes. I''m a sucker for big eyes.', '2008-03-12 21:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559870, 656018, 90658, '<td valign="top">Way too much going on in the background.  I get that this shot would not make sense without something in the background, but I would rather see it or see less of it.  My blurring it completely with a dof change, I get left wondering why he''s wearing a hat and a rain coat.</td>', 'Way too much going on in the background.  I get that this shot would not make sense without something in the background, but I would rather see it or see less of it.  My blurring it completely with a dof change, I get left wondering why he''s wearing a hat and a rain coat.', '2008-03-12 21:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559872, 655756, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just darn good. I suspect some may critique the flattened appearance that the water gives this, but I think it adds to the image.</td>', 'Just darn good. I suspect some may critique the flattened appearance that the water gives this, but I think it adds to the image.', '2008-03-12 21:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559873, 656170, 70514, '<td valign="top">I am pulled to the fingers as they''re in focus, unlike the eye, which I would consider to be the subject.</td>', 'I am pulled to the fingers as they''re in focus, unlike the eye, which I would consider to be the subject.', '2008-03-12 21:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
