(4559882, 656268, 90658, '<td valign="top">Stuck in the middle.  Too sharp to be soft focus, to soft to be sharp focus.  So it just looks blurry and washed out.  Cute little guy, though.</td>', 'Stuck in the middle.  Too sharp to be soft focus, to soft to be sharp focus.  So it just looks blurry and washed out.  Cute little guy, though.', '2008-03-12 21:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559884, 656233, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interestin concept.</td>', 'Interestin concept.', '2008-03-12 21:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559887, 656287, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love how everyone looks perplexed just standing there, except of course for the one''s that know exactly what they''re doing, as evidenced by their blur.  Very cool capture and idea.</td>', 'I love how everyone looks perplexed just standing there, except of course for the one''s that know exactly what they''re doing, as evidenced by their blur.  Very cool capture and idea.', '2008-03-12 21:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559888, 656318, 90658, '<td valign="top">Freaky and over-editted.  Probably what you wanted, but not so wonderful for me.</td>', 'Freaky and over-editted.  Probably what you wanted, but not so wonderful for me.', '2008-03-12 21:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559891, 656188, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a wild and very cool find!</td>', 'What a wild and very cool find!', '2008-03-12 21:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559894, 654490, 90658, '<td valign="top">Kind of wondering what he''s looking at.  It''s like something used to be in the picture and now isn''t.</td>', 'Kind of wondering what he''s looking at.  It''s like something used to be in the picture and now isn''t.', '2008-03-12 21:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559899, 656175, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the lighting on this image.  The face is so red against the hands.  Might be the effect you''re going for though.  Just not my preference here.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the lighting on this image.  The face is so red against the hands.  Might be the effect you''re going for though.  Just not my preference here.', '2008-03-12 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559903, 654298, 90658, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I had a hard time with this one.  My first instinct was that the shading was too dark, but then we lose the "smile", then I wondered what the gold band and "glasses" looking thing were, then I realized that while I was smiling, I was spending waaaaaaay too much time attempting to figure this out.</td>', 'Honestly, I had a hard time with this one.  My first instinct was that the shading was too dark, but then we lose the "smile", then I wondered what the gold band and "glasses" looking thing were, then I realized that while I was smiling, I was spending waaaaaaay too much time attempting to figure this out.', '2008-03-12 22:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559904, 655437, 70514, '<td valign="top">This is quite subtle and very lovely.  Great processing and wonderful composition.  I only wish I could see the entire body.  Seems to be cut off at the knees, which just distracts me some.</td>', 'This is quite subtle and very lovely.  Great processing and wonderful composition.  I only wish I could see the entire body.  Seems to be cut off at the knees, which just distracts me some.', '2008-03-12 22:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
