(4559931, 655582, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and portrait piece.  What I find odd is the title says she see''s herself, but she''s looking at me.</td>', 'Nice lighting and portrait piece.  What I find odd is the title says she see''s herself, but she''s looking at me.', '2008-03-12 22:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
