(4559939, 656286, 90658, '<td valign="top">While I like the fact that the cage is part of the overall shot, the eyes don''t seem that well framed withing the wire.  The nose is better composed, and that''s not the point of the shot is it?</td>', 'While I like the fact that the cage is part of the overall shot, the eyes don''t seem that well framed withing the wire.  The nose is better composed, and that''s not the point of the shot is it?', '2008-03-12 22:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559945, 655429, 70514, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh.  Great processing, love the curve of the street.  Your timing is flawless here.  Nice capture.</td>', 'This made me laugh.  Great processing, love the curve of the street.  Your timing is flawless here.  Nice capture.', '2008-03-12 22:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
