(4559950, 656175, 90658, '<td valign="top">I generally prefer natural lighting.  But this time, not your friend.  Face is too pink, hands are washed out.  You can tell your subject is fighting the sun by the wrinkles in the forehead.</td>', 'I generally prefer natural lighting.  But this time, not your friend.  Face is too pink, hands are washed out.  You can tell your subject is fighting the sun by the wrinkles in the forehead.', '2008-03-12 22:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559955, 656211, 70514, '<td valign="top">Fun play on words, nice texture on the stuffed animal.</td>', 'Fun play on words, nice texture on the stuffed animal.', '2008-03-12 22:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559961, 656332, 90658, '<td valign="top">Poochy just looks too tired.  No spark in his eye, no spark in the picture.  Also, the blue is a better color against his coat, then the pink.</td>', 'Poochy just looks too tired.  No spark in his eye, no spark in the picture.  Also, the blue is a better color against his coat, then the pink.', '2008-03-12 22:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559962, 655806, 90658, '<td valign="top">To my eyes the dof of focus is off.  I am drawn to the blue shell/coral in the front not to the fish.  Of course, by the title, you could have done that on purpose :)</td>', 'To my eyes the dof of focus is off.  I am drawn to the blue shell/coral in the front not to the fish.  Of course, by the title, you could have done that on purpose :)', '2008-03-12 22:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559964, 656170, 90658, '<td valign="top">Odd focal point for me.  Why the fingers and nose?</td>', 'Odd focal point for me.  Why the fingers and nose?', '2008-03-12 22:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559970, 656073, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think this might be better presented from a slightly different angle and perhaps in sepia as opposed to b&amp;w.</td>', 'I think this might be better presented from a slightly different angle and perhaps in sepia as opposed to b&w.', '2008-03-12 22:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559971, 656077, 90658, '<td valign="top">Just a hint more cropping of the top would add more balance to this shot.</td>', 'Just a hint more cropping of the top would add more balance to this shot.', '2008-03-12 22:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559974, 656300, 90658, '<td valign="top">The colors seem blown out to me.  I do love that you went with natural lighting, but it seems disproportionate.</td>', 'The colors seem blown out to me.  I do love that you went with natural lighting, but it seems disproportionate.', '2008-03-12 22:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559977, 656329, 90658, '<td valign="top">This shot reminds me of my little one.  Either we just woke up, just finished a tantrum, or are just ready to go to sleep.  The blue of the eye is well set-off by the skin tone and sleeves.  I can see your reflection, though.</td>', 'This shot reminds me of my little one.  Either we just woke up, just finished a tantrum, or are just ready to go to sleep.  The blue of the eye is well set-off by the skin tone and sleeves.  I can see your reflection, though.', '2008-03-12 22:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559981, 656329, 70514, '<td valign="top">Lovely focus on the eye.  What a sleepy child... it''s too bad about the right arm right there, and the pacifier, but what can you do during these instances?</td>', 'Lovely focus on the eye.  What a sleepy child... it''s too bad about the right arm right there, and the pacifier, but what can you do during these instances?', '2008-03-12 22:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
