(4559988, 656123, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very cute and sweet.  The white balance seems a tad off though, and wish I could see all the legs of the child on my left.</td>', 'Very cute and sweet.  The white balance seems a tad off though, and wish I could see all the legs of the child on my left.', '2008-03-12 22:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559995, 656179, 70514, '<td valign="top">Love the processing here.  I think for me, it might have been a bit more dramatic to have cut off the right half and top portion of this to only show her face and hand.  No hair or negative space.  But what do I know?</td>', 'Love the processing here.  I think for me, it might have been a bit more dramatic to have cut off the right half and top portion of this to only show her face and hand.  No hair or negative space.  But what do I know?', '2008-03-12 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559997, 655276, 90658, '<td valign="top">While not strictly in the vein of the challenge and slightly gross to boot, I appreciate what you did here.  This would be a really cool shot if you could find some way to support the banana so that it looks like it was just floating.</td>', 'While not strictly in the vein of the challenge and slightly gross to boot, I appreciate what you did here.  This would be a really cool shot if you could find some way to support the banana so that it looks like it was just floating.', '2008-03-12 22:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
