(4561808, 656248, 68586, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure how this fits the challenge - but looking at the photo generally . .<br/>I like the crop - it helps give it depth,<br/>I like the rocks coming in both side to draw the eye in.<br/>The sky has (potentially) some nice shapes and colours.<br/> <br/>However the whole picture looks a little underexposed - so the rocks lose a little definition and the colours in the sky are washed out. As for the person standing there - I''m afraid I''m not really sure what that''s about, or why they are there.<br/> <br/>Looks very impressive scenary though.</td>', 'I''m really not sure how this fits the challenge - but looking at the photo generally . .I like the crop - it helps give it depth,I like the rocks coming in both side to draw the eye in.The sky has (potentially) some nice shapes and colours. However the whole picture looks a little underexposed - so the rocks lose a little definition and the colours in the sky are washed out. As for the person standing there - I''m afraid I''m not really sure what that''s about, or why they are there. Looks very impressive scenary though.', '2008-03-13 14:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561819, 656246, 68586, '<td valign="top">A very interesting idea, and I like the little details like the texture on the wall - but ultimately for me, I don''t think it quite comes off.<br/> <br/>The ball is just to indistinct, and personally I would rather that the side of his face i shadow was either completely in shadow or was illuminated. <br/> <br/>That is obviously a personal view though :- ) <br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very interesting idea, and I like the little details like the texture on the wall - but ultimately for me, I don''t think it quite comes off. The ball is just to indistinct, and personally I would rather that the side of his face i shadow was either completely in shadow or was illuminated.  That is obviously a personal view though :- )  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-03-13 14:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
