(4561862, 656056, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice title to draw the viewer into the picture.<br/> <br/>With the squirrels long thin shape, and all the long thin branches he gets a little lost. In some ways this is almost good as it fits the idea of him trying not to be seen, but for visual impact he probably needs a different crop. There is a danger that to any passing voter he just gets lost in the strong visual lines.<br/> <br/>If you could have captured him peeking around a branch instead it would have been even better  :- )<br/> <br/>Good luck though.</td>', 'Nice title to draw the viewer into the picture. With the squirrels long thin shape, and all the long thin branches he gets a little lost. In some ways this is almost good as it fits the idea of him trying not to be seen, but for visual impact he probably needs a different crop. There is a danger that to any passing voter he just gets lost in the strong visual lines. If you could have captured him peeking around a branch instead it would have been even better  :- ) Good luck though.', '2008-03-13 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
