(4562006, 656204, 68586, '<td valign="top">It might just be me, but this shot carries slightly disturbing undertones to it, and I think the length of heavy chain in the shot adds to that. <br/> <br/>Technicals are fine - but does it say ''Peek-a-Boo'' to me ?<br/> <br/>With it''s current title - probably not.</td>', 'It might just be me, but this shot carries slightly disturbing undertones to it, and I think the length of heavy chain in the shot adds to that.  Technicals are fine - but does it say ''Peek-a-Boo'' to me ? With it''s current title - probably not.', '2008-03-13 15:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562007, 656305, 30791, '<td valign="top">is that a mole? ive never seen someone with a mole for a pet before</td>', 'is that a mole? ive never seen someone with a mole for a pet before', '2008-03-13 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562014, 655429, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very curious shot. It''s like a picture within a picture.<br/> <br/>Nice crop, it''s a bit of a pity that the triangle on the road top right didn''t quite point straight out the corner of the shot, but the positioning of the van is great and the shape made by the underpass is good. There is a nice diagonal formed betweeen the triangle on the road, the van, the people, and the patch of missing tiles, cutting from top right to bottom left and being intersected by the curve of the underpass. great geometry.</td>', 'Very curious shot. It''s like a picture within a picture. Nice crop, it''s a bit of a pity that the triangle on the road top right didn''t quite point straight out the corner of the shot, but the positioning of the van is great and the shape made by the underpass is good. There is a nice diagonal formed betweeen the triangle on the road, the van, the people, and the patch of missing tiles, cutting from top right to bottom left and being intersected by the curve of the underpass. great geometry.', '2008-03-13 15:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562016, 656188, 68586, '<td valign="top">I really like the geometry on this shot and B&amp;W conversion. I''m really not sure where the Peek-a-boo comes in , but who cares. Nice shot</td>', 'I really like the geometry on this shot and B&W conversion. I''m really not sure where the Peek-a-boo comes in , but who cares. Nice shot', '2008-03-13 15:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4562023, 656077, 68586, '<td valign="top">If he''s watching me I''m calling the Police  :- )<br/> <br/>Nice positioning of the face in the little hollow.</td>', 'If he''s watching me I''m calling the Police  :- ) Nice positioning of the face in the little hollow.', '2008-03-13 15:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
