(4562027, 656236, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - the whole picture is a little too yellow though - including the face. There really needs to be a difference in colour to draw your eye in to see the person looking back at the viewer.</td>', 'Nice idea - the whole picture is a little too yellow though - including the face. There really needs to be a difference in colour to draw your eye in to see the person looking back at the viewer.', '2008-03-13 15:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
