(4566248, 655884, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like when people try high key images, as they seem more challenging to pull off well.  I like this one, and would only note that there are a couple of hard creases and associated shadows above and to the right of her face that that are a bit distracting.  The arcing crease and softer shadow on the lower left seems okay, less distracting.  Another try of this with a little tuning on the cloth draping and a bit more even lighting of it might well be worth the time and effort.</td>', 'I like when people try high key images, as they seem more challenging to pull off well.  I like this one, and would only note that there are a couple of hard creases and associated shadows above and to the right of her face that that are a bit distracting.  The arcing crease and softer shadow on the lower left seems okay, less distracting.  Another try of this with a little tuning on the cloth draping and a bit more even lighting of it might well be worth the time and effort.', '2008-03-15 20:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4566263, 655975, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is very well composed, and I like the tonality. I hate to say it needs a little more "snap" contrast-wise, because that is cliche'' and kind of a generic comment to make--but I might like to see it that way for grins.  Well seen.</td>', 'This is very well composed, and I like the tonality. I hate to say it needs a little more "snap" contrast-wise, because that is cliche'' and kind of a generic comment to make--but I might like to see it that way for grins.  Well seen.', '2008-03-15 20:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4566267, 656287, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like this image (very well done) but am missing the challenge connection here.</td>', 'I like this image (very well done) but am missing the challenge connection here.', '2008-03-15 20:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4566274, 656228, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like this, and the hint of screen sneaks up on you.  The squirrel seems to be mocking and laughing at the cat, which just makes this image work.</td>', 'I like this, and the hint of screen sneaks up on you.  The squirrel seems to be mocking and laughing at the cat, which just makes this image work.', '2008-03-15 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4566278, 655199, 82985, '<td valign="top">creepy and great.  though, I wonder if the spider is peeking at us, or mooning us?</td>', 'creepy and great.  though, I wonder if the spider is peeking at us, or mooning us?', '2008-03-15 20:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4566290, 656271, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is just wonderful.  I wonder how it might look with a little tweek away from blue to a slightly warmer tone (just a tad)....</td>', 'This is just wonderful.  I wonder how it might look with a little tweek away from blue to a slightly warmer tone (just a tad)....', '2008-03-15 21:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4566332, 656236, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the image. It might be worth tweeking it just a bit away from the tungsten lighting orange cast -- not all the way to "perfect" white balance, as that might be too cold, but so that the warmth of tone comes more from the wood.  A small localized burn of the bright highlight in the upper left might also help, as it tends to pull the viewer''s eye over there.  I really like all the shadows, lines, shapes and forms here.  For this challenge, the subtle "peeking" is good--if you have ready access to this location, one of these with no face might be worth it, too.</td>', 'I like the composition and the image. It might be worth tweeking it just a bit away from the tungsten lighting orange cast -- not all the way to "perfect" white balance, as that might be too cold, but so that the warmth of tone comes more from the wood.  A small localized burn of the bright highlight in the upper left might also help, as it tends to pull the viewer''s eye over there.  I really like all the shadows, lines, shapes and forms here.  For this challenge, the subtle "peeking" is good--if you have ready access to this location, one of these with no face might be worth it, too.', '2008-03-15 21:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
