(4567892, 655270, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is very well captured, and for me incredibly sad - the chain in the right of the frame adds to that feel.  The animal forced into playing a never ending game of peekaboo with the hoards of gawping visitors.</td>', 'This is very well captured, and for me incredibly sad - the chain in the right of the frame adds to that feel.  The animal forced into playing a never ending game of peekaboo with the hoards of gawping visitors.', '2008-03-16 19:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
