(4567947, 656085, 76185, '<td valign="top">Very green. Good use of lighting and isolation, although perhaps a little too jarring in terms of brightness.</td>', 'Very green. Good use of lighting and isolation, although perhaps a little too jarring in terms of brightness.', '2008-03-16 19:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
