(4568381, 656305, 44877, '<td valign="top">In the off chance that this little creature crawled into the pineapple on its own, please disregard what I''m about to say. <br/> <br/>This looks like animal cruelty to me, and I don''t condone it for any purpose, including taking a ''cute'' photo. I''m not going to vote on this image, since in my opinion, it''s in bad taste.<br/> <br/>Edit to add - thanks for the explanation. Note that I started out my comment with a disclaimer. It wasn''t my aim to upset or insult you. However, I''d rather risk someone''s disagreement with me if I can speak on behalf of an animal. It seems, in this case it wasn''t necessary.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-17 19:56:30.</i></td>', 'In the off chance that this little creature crawled into the pineapple on its own, please disregard what I''m about to say.  This looks like animal cruelty to me, and I don''t condone it for any purpose, including taking a ''cute'' photo. I''m not going to vote on this image, since in my opinion, it''s in bad taste. Edit to add - thanks for the explanation. Note that I started out my comment with a disclaimer. It wasn''t my aim to upset or insult you. However, I''d rather risk someone''s disagreement with me if I can speak on behalf of an animal. It seems, in this case it wasn''t necessary.', '2008-03-16 23:50:46.000000', '2008-03-17 19:56:30.000000', 1),
