(4568428, 655899, 53147, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I really expected this to be much higher in score and rank. What i really liked about this shot compared to many of the "double exposure" type shots in past challenges is the shift in position. Not just from side to side, but the angle taken by your model in the second pose. Turned it from what would have been a static shot to somethign with way more life. Great light, great editing - should have scored much higher IMO.</td>', 'Hmmm. I really expected this to be much higher in score and rank. What i really liked about this shot compared to many of the "double exposure" type shots in past challenges is the shift in position. Not just from side to side, but the angle taken by your model in the second pose. Turned it from what would have been a static shot to somethign with way more life. Great light, great editing - should have scored much higher IMO.', '2008-03-17 00:10:51.000000', NULL, 0),
