(4568545, 655756, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG . when i wrote those last two comments i didnt realise that this was  PB as well .. so double congratulations sandy ... <br/>an awsome photograph and an awesome and extremely well deserved score ... :)x<br/>and wow .. not a 1 or 1 2 in sight .. !!<br/>i''m thinking tho that this is a very ''friendly'' image .. i cant see how it could upset anyone or give them the heeby jeebies, like an insect for example, and yet you got 3''s, 4''s and 5''s .. who are those ppl .. ??<br/>i''m really getting ''annoyed'' with ppl who give out that sort of score when the image is so obviously brilliant .. ''annoyed'' is an understatement .. :)</td>', 'OMG . when i wrote those last two comments i didnt realise that this was  PB as well .. so double congratulations sandy ... an awsome photograph and an awesome and extremely well deserved score ... :)xand wow .. not a 1 or 1 2 in sight .. !!i''m thinking tho that this is a very ''friendly'' image .. i cant see how it could upset anyone or give them the heeby jeebies, like an insect for example, and yet you got 3''s, 4''s and 5''s .. who are those ppl .. ??i''m really getting ''annoyed'' with ppl who give out that sort of score when the image is so obviously brilliant .. ''annoyed'' is an understatement .. :)', '2008-03-17 00:56:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4568548, 655756, 18450, '<td valign="top">Congrats Sandy (((((hugs)))) What an amazing shot!</td>', 'Congrats Sandy (((((hugs)))) What an amazing shot!', '2008-03-17 00:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4568549, 656292, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good job and nice finish for a first challenge entry. This is an advanced editing challenge too, which makes the good score even better.  I believe that I would have cropped the top off, right down to the eyes, and left the crab peeking out of the image, and his reflection to show that it was a hermit crab.  Try scrolling down so that it is cropped that far at the top of the screen, and you will see what I am talking about. It would fit the challenge description better that way.  <br/>Just my opinion. <br/>Hope to see more of your work here in the future.</td>', 'Good job and nice finish for a first challenge entry. This is an advanced editing challenge too, which makes the good score even better.  I believe that I would have cropped the top off, right down to the eyes, and left the crab peeking out of the image, and his reflection to show that it was a hermit crab.  Try scrolling down so that it is cropped that far at the top of the screen, and you will see what I am talking about. It would fit the challenge description better that way.  Just my opinion. Hope to see more of your work here in the future.', '2008-03-17 00:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
