(4568552, 655756, 62318, '<td valign="top">Congrats Sandy. It was a beautiful animal shot that fit the challenge so very well. Love the detail and the framing.</td>', 'Congrats Sandy. It was a beautiful animal shot that fit the challenge so very well. Love the detail and the framing.', '2008-03-17 00:58:15.000000', NULL, 0),
