(4568573, 656018, 62318, '<td valign="top">Left or Right muffin eyed, that is the question. Funny take on the material. I might have cropped just a bit off the top to remove the white, but still and engaging portrait as is.</td>', 'Left or Right muffin eyed, that is the question. Funny take on the material. I might have cropped just a bit off the top to remove the white, but still and engaging portrait as is.', '2008-03-17 01:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
