(4569169, 656175, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I don''t see any reference in your editing notes to added texture.  Am I seeing things here, or is your skin naturally lined?  They seem quite visible on the forehead and underneath the main eye.  How was that effect achieved?  Can you share please?  :-)</td>', 'Hmmm.  I don''t see any reference in your editing notes to added texture.  Am I seeing things here, or is your skin naturally lined?  They seem quite visible on the forehead and underneath the main eye.  How was that effect achieved?  Can you share please?  :-)', '2008-03-17 10:41:52.000000', NULL, 0),
