(4569257, 655138, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, Tate.  I didn''t comment during the challenge, but I''ll give you my thoughts (which ain''t much from someone who rarely makes top 50%).  The exposure and processing is perfect.  A portrait shot of the right half would have been much better.  A bit of a smile would be a bonus.  Finally, the pipes really bothered me.  The same scene without the pipes would have been great.</td>', 'Nice shot, Tate.  I didn''t comment during the challenge, but I''ll give you my thoughts (which ain''t much from someone who rarely makes top 50%).  The exposure and processing is perfect.  A portrait shot of the right half would have been much better.  A bit of a smile would be a bonus.  Finally, the pipes really bothered me.  The same scene without the pipes would have been great.', '2008-03-17 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
