(4570697, 655756, 34938, '<td valign="top">Hi Sandi,<br/> <br/>Iam currently in the Philippines in a Gloria Jeans Coffee shop in the middle of Tacloban City, a very poor region of this area. We are here to speak at some pastors conferences and churches. <br/> <br/>Despite the super slow wireless connection here, I just had to comment on this superb image and how this little guy/gal has locked in to your Canon 70-200 2.8 lens! I LOVE this, and had to congratulate you on your much deserved BLUE!<br/> <br/>Not only did you get a Blue but also a PB so double congratulations!<br/> <br/>Enzo - on assignemnt in The Philippines!</td>', 'Hi Sandi, Iam currently in the Philippines in a Gloria Jeans Coffee shop in the middle of Tacloban City, a very poor region of this area. We are here to speak at some pastors conferences and churches.  Despite the super slow wireless connection here, I just had to comment on this superb image and how this little guy/gal has locked in to your Canon 70-200 2.8 lens! I LOVE this, and had to congratulate you on your much deserved BLUE! Not only did you get a Blue but also a PB so double congratulations! Enzo - on assignemnt in The Philippines!', '2008-03-18 05:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4570699, 656029, 34938, '<td valign="top">this is stunning...having seen some leopards in the wild in Kenya, they are amazing animals. perfect for the challenge! Enzo</td>', 'this is stunning...having seen some leopards in the wild in Kenya, they are amazing animals. perfect for the challenge! Enzo', '2008-03-18 05:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
