(4570703, 656233, 70661, '<td valign="top">Your pictures are so unique. This was a great idea for the challenge!</td>', 'Your pictures are so unique. This was a great idea for the challenge!', '2008-03-18 05:35:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4570704, 655437, 70661, '<td valign="top">Love the textures in the wood. This is just an awesome shot!</td>', 'Love the textures in the wood. This is just an awesome shot!', '2008-03-18 05:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4570705, 655375, 70661, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors Brian!</td>', 'Awesome colors Brian!', '2008-03-18 05:38:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4570748, 655884, 71376, '<td valign="top">hi, i am absolutely in Love with this image! and talking of art.. well people here wud usually only judge photography on a very strange level.. if the image is absolutely sharp and light is perfect, it would just become one of the first 3, no matter if there is no thought put behind it. art is of lesser value, the reason for which is strangely unknown to me as well... as photography to me an absolute form of art, like this work by you. It is truly an outstanding piece. the washed away feel, the translucent eyes, the framing, the pattern on the cloth , everything is amazing.<br/> <br/></td>', 'hi, i am absolutely in Love with this image! and talking of art.. well people here wud usually only judge photography on a very strange level.. if the image is absolutely sharp and light is perfect, it would just become one of the first 3, no matter if there is no thought put behind it. art is of lesser value, the reason for which is strangely unknown to me as well... as photography to me an absolute form of art, like this work by you. It is truly an outstanding piece. the washed away feel, the translucent eyes, the framing, the pattern on the cloth , everything is amazing. ', '2008-03-18 06:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4570785, 656029, 63267, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo.  Congratulation on the ribbon and an excellent capture!</td>', 'Brilliant photo.  Congratulation on the ribbon and an excellent capture!', '2008-03-18 08:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4570888, 654490, 62895, '<td valign="top">It''s a good concept, but I think the things that would have helped your picture out a bit would be if the black line across his face and hands was straight and if the lighting was a little less orangy and maybe had some more depth.</td>', 'It''s a good concept, but I think the things that would have helped your picture out a bit would be if the black line across his face and hands was straight and if the lighting was a little less orangy and maybe had some more depth.', '2008-03-18 09:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
