(4586126, 656161, 62787, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by basssman7:</b></div><hr/><i> This shot was way under rated in my opinion. She looks like she is peeking around the leaf, and the lighting and expression are perfect. :)  Is she a Russian Blue or a domestic short hair that is simply beautiful? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>She''s a Burmese, I believe. They''re beautiful cats, and also very cuddly and friendly :)</td>', 'Originally posted by basssman7: This shot was way under rated in my opinion. She looks like she is peeking around the leaf, and the lighting and expression are perfect. :)  Is she a Russian Blue or a domestic short hair that is simply beautiful?   She''s a Burmese, I believe. They''re beautiful cats, and also very cuddly and friendly :)', '2008-03-25 15:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
